<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Dillon, Read starts three banks.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Dillon, Read starts three banks.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dillon, Read said analyst Anthony Davis initiated coverage of three bank stocks.</p>
<p>-- put a buy rating on Signet Banking Corp, with a 12-to-18 month price target of $47. It rose 1/4 to 36-1/4.</p>
<p>-- put an outperform rating on Summit Bancorp with a $60 12-to-18 month price target. It added 3/8 to 50-1/2.</p>
<p>-- rated Crestar Financial with a $47 12-to-18 month target. It was up 1-3/8 to 40-1/4.</p>
</text>
